n: 3.15.8.6
name: digest-under-20ns-on-probe-path
kind: finding
is: If a cryptographic digest sits on a path that also probes a large table, keep the digest under about 20 ns or batch the probes: with a digest of 50 to 100 ns, the cost of a mint beyond its digest rose from 16 to 28 ns to 74 to 108 ns.
status: inferred
conf: mid
from: 3.15.3.7
limit: Rests on an inference about overlapping memory misses that was not confirmed with a prefetching variant.
at: 2026-11-24
